// template: Disco Lights
// order: 2
// Disco house: octave bass, muted guitar chops, brass stabs through an opening filter,
// string runs into the drop.
title "Disco Lights"
tempo 118
key g major
kick:    kick     crisp     x... x... x... x... | gain 0.9
clap:    clap     tight     .... x... .... x...                                   | reverb small | gain 1.83
hat:     hat      closed    x x?0.6 x x?0.8 x x?0.6 x x?0.8 x x?0.6 x x?0.8 x x?0.6 x x?0.9   | swing 0.1 | pan -0.2 | gain 0.4
ohat:    hat      metal     ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.                                   | gain 1.51 | pan 0.2
shaker:  shaker   bright    x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7   | swing 0.1 | gain 0.18 | pan 0.3
conga:   conga    low       . . x . x . . x . . x . . x x?0.6 .                   | swing 0.1 | pan -0.35 | reverb small | gain 0.55
bell:    cowbell  bright    x . . . . . . . x . . . . . . . / x . . . . . . . x . . . x . . .   | pan 0.4 | gain 0.3
block:   perc     block     .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... x.x. xxxx   | reverb small | pan -0.25 | gain 0.51
bass:    bass     rolling   c2 c3 c2 c3 c2 c3 b1 b2 / b1 b2 b1 b2 b1 b2 a1 a2 / a1 a2 a1 a2 a1 a2 d2 d3 / d2 d3 d2 d3 d2 d3 c2 d2   | cutoff sine(4) 900..2600 | duck 0.5 | gain 1.03
guitar:  pluck    muted     Cmaj7 . Cmaj7 . . Cmaj7 . Cmaj7 . . Cmaj7 . . Cmaj7 . . / Bm7 . Bm7 . . Bm7 . Bm7 . . Bm7 . . Bm7 . . / Am7 . Am7 . . Am7 . Am7 . . Am7 . . Am7 . . / D . D . . D . D . . D . . D . .   | voicing open | pan 0.3 | duck 0.4 | gain 0.5
brass:   brass    section   . . . Cmaj7 . . Cmaj7 . / . . . Bm7 . . Bm7 . / . . . Am7 . . Am7 . / . . . D . . D .   | cutoff saw(16) 800..5000 | reverb small | gain 0.5
strings: strings  ensemble  Cmaj7 ~ ~ ~ / Bm7 ~ ~ ~ / Am7 ~ ~ ~ / D ~ ~ ~         | brightness sine(16) 0.3..0.8 | reverb sea | gain 0.27
run:     strings  high      . . . . . . . . / . . . . . . . . / . . . . . . . . / g4 a4 b4 c5 d5 e5 f#5 g5   | reverb wide | gain 0.5
keys:    epiano   tine      . Cmaj7 . . Cmaj7 . . . / . Bm7 . . Bm7 . . . / . Am7 . . Am7 . . . / . D . . D . D .   | chorus 0.3 | reverb wide | gain 0.5
voice:   vox      talk      d4 . b3 . . . . . / . . . . . . . . / c4 . a3 . . . . . / . . . . d4 ~ ~ ~   | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | pan -0.2 | gain 0.55
rise:    noise    white     x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                   | cutoff saw(8) 300..9000 | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.5
riser:   riser    both      x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | length 15.5 | gain 0.5
down:    downlifter noise   x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.6
crash:   crash    wide      x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.45
section intro   kick hat shaker conga guitar
section groove  kick clap hat ohat shaker conga bass guitar brass | loop
section build   kick clap hat shaker conga block guitar brass strings run rise riser
section drop    kick clap hat ohat shaker conga bell block bass guitar brass strings run voice crash
section break   strings keys voice run down
section groove2 kick clap hat ohat shaker conga bass guitar keys voice
section drop2   kick clap hat ohat shaker conga bell block bass guitar brass strings run keys voice crash
section outro   kick hat shaker conga guitar
song intro 16, groove 32, build 8, drop 32, break 16, build 8, drop2 32, groove2 16, outro 16
